        <mxCell id="wOe7zqhs2_QcdCpgvtuy-24" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;div class=&quot;n6owBd awi2gc&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-sfc-cb=&quot;&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAAIAxAA&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px none rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px none rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-subtree=&quot;aimfl&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px none rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px none rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;Microsoft Fabric Lakehouse serves as a unified platform for storing, transforming, and analyzing diverse data types, utilizing the Delta Parquet format and supporting ACID transactions, OneLake flexibility, and AI-powered analytics. The architecture enables automatic generation of a SQL analytics endpoint and semantic model for Power BI, along with robust data ingestion options via Spark notebooks, pipelines, and shortcuts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;n6owBd awi2gc&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-sfc-cb=&quot;&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAAIBBAA&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; aria-owns=&quot;action-menu-parent-container&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px none rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px none rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;Microsoft Fabric Lakehouse overview and lab&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="220" width="560" x="73.5" y="7060" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
