        <UserObject label="&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-turn-id-container=&quot;5a00e23b-5492-43b6-91e4-de6d6c1c8ea0&quot; data-is-intersecting=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;section class=&quot;text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;amp;:has([data-writing-block])&amp;gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-(--header-height)&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; data-turn-id=&quot;5a00e23b-5492-43b6-91e4-de6d6c1c8ea0&quot; data-turn-id-container=&quot;5a00e23b-5492-43b6-91e4-de6d6c1c8ea0&quot; data-testid=&quot;conversation-turn-1&quot; data-turn=&quot;user&quot;&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-turn-id-container=&quot;request-WEB:54a30f55-4d2c-4779-ad98-c4ce37634e11-0&quot; data-is-intersecting=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;section class=&quot;text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;amp;:has([data-writing-block])&amp;gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; data-turn-id=&quot;request-WEB:54a30f55-4d2c-4779-ad98-c4ce37634e11-0&quot; data-turn-id-container=&quot;request-WEB:54a30f55-4d2c-4779-ad98-c4ce37634e11-0&quot; data-testid=&quot;conversation-turn-2&quot; data-turn=&quot;assistant&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-conversation-screenshot-content=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-message-author-role=&quot;assistant&quot; data-message-id=&quot;f27f3ac8-ede4-43e5-b3f2-aecba02c9d75&quot; data-turn-start-message=&quot;true&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot; data-message-model-slug=&quot;gpt-5-5&quot; class=&quot;min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;amp;]:mt-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 data-section-id=&quot;xpkx0g&quot; data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;70&quot;&gt;Get Started with Lakehouses in Microsoft Fabric — Structured Summary&lt;/h1&gt;&#xa;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;e9nhlm&quot; data-start=&quot;72&quot; data-end=&quot;115&quot;&gt;1. What is a Microsoft Fabric Lakehouse?&lt;/h2&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;117&quot; data-end=&quot;201&quot;&gt;A &lt;strong data-start=&quot;119&quot; data-end=&quot;132&quot;&gt;Lakehouse&lt;/strong&gt; is a modern data architecture in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;166&quot; data-end=&quot;186&quot;&gt;Microsoft Fabric&lt;/strong&gt; that combines:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;203&quot; data-end=&quot;320&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1r49udg&quot; data-start=&quot;203&quot; data-end=&quot;256&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;205&quot; data-end=&quot;218&quot;&gt;Data Lake&lt;/strong&gt; capabilities (store any type of data)&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1n8mnlj&quot; data-start=&quot;257&quot; data-end=&quot;320&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;259&quot; data-end=&quot;277&quot;&gt;Data Warehouse&lt;/strong&gt; capabilities (SQL analytics and reporting)&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xa;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;12ke97o&quot; data-start=&quot;322&quot; data-end=&quot;340&quot;&gt;Key Definition&lt;/h3&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;341&quot; data-end=&quot;365&quot;&gt;A Lakehouse is used for:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;367&quot; data-end=&quot;461&quot;&gt;✅ Storing data&lt;br data-start=&quot;381&quot; data-end=&quot;384&quot;&gt;&#xa;✅ Transforming data&lt;br data-start=&quot;403&quot; data-end=&quot;406&quot;&gt;&#xa;✅ Managing data&lt;br data-start=&quot;421&quot; data-end=&quot;424&quot;&gt;&#xa;✅ Analyzing data&lt;br data-start=&quot;440&quot; data-end=&quot;443&quot;&gt;&#xa;✅ Visualizing data&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;463&quot; data-end=&quot;521&quot;&gt;All data is stored in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;485&quot; data-end=&quot;509&quot;&gt;Delta Parquet format&lt;/strong&gt; by default.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;523&quot; data-end=&quot;526&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;zchhsa&quot; data-start=&quot;528&quot; data-end=&quot;562&quot;&gt;2. Core Features of a Lakehouse&lt;/h2&gt;&#xa;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;10gwk2l&quot; data-start=&quot;564&quot; data-end=&quot;583&quot;&gt;Data Processing&lt;/h3&gt;&#xa;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;584&quot; data-end=&quot;705&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;cp27iq&quot; data-start=&quot;584&quot; data-end=&quot;645&quot;&gt;&#xa;Uses &lt;strong data-start=&quot;591&quot; data-end=&quot;607&quot;&gt;Apache Spark&lt;/strong&gt; for large-scale data transformations.&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;b7t2t8&quot; data-start=&quot;646&quot; data-end=&quot;705&quot;&gt;&#xa;Supports:&#xa;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;660&quot; data-end=&quot;705&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;jlfqd6&quot; data-start=&quot;660&quot; data-end=&quot;669&quot;&gt;&#xa;PySpark&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i2cewt&quot; data-start=&quot;672&quot; data-end=&quot;683&quot;&gt;&#xa;Spark SQL&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;178n5jo&quot; data-start=&quot;686&quot; data-end=&quot;693&quot;&gt;&#xa;Scala&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1mvssht&quot; data-start=&quot;696&quot; data-end=&quot;705&quot;&gt;&#xa;Spark R&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xa;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1ye34zi&quot; data-start=&quot;707&quot; data-end=&quot;724&quot;&gt;SQL Analytics&lt;/h3&gt;&#xa;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;725&quot; data-end=&quot;830&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;9awhse&quot; data-start=&quot;725&quot; data-end=&quot;778&quot;&gt;&#xa;Automatically creates a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;751&quot; data-end=&quot;777&quot;&gt;SQL Analytics Endpoint&lt;/strong&gt;.&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;pt27ul&quot; data-start=&quot;779&quot; data-end=&quot;830&quot;&gt;&#xa;Allows querying Lakehouse tables using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;820&quot; data-end=&quot;829&quot;&gt;T-SQL&lt;/strong&gt;.&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xa;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;luimda&quot; data-start=&quot;832&quot; data-end=&quot;853&quot;&gt;ACID Transactions&lt;/h3&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;854&quot; data-end=&quot;863&quot;&gt;Supports:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;div class=&quot;TyagGW_tableContainer&quot;&gt;&lt;div tabindex=&quot;-1&quot; class=&quot;group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit&quot;&gt;&lt;table data-start=&quot;865&quot; data-end=&quot;1078&quot; class=&quot;w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)&quot;&gt;&lt;thead data-start=&quot;865&quot; data-end=&quot;892&quot;&gt;&lt;tr data-start=&quot;865&quot; data-end=&quot;892&quot;&gt;&lt;th data-start=&quot;865&quot; data-end=&quot;881&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot; class=&quot;last:pe-10&quot;&gt;ACID Property&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th data-start=&quot;881&quot; data-end=&quot;892&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot; c