strong&gt; with the SQL analytics capabilities of a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;7126&quot; data-end=&quot;7144&quot;&gt;Data Warehouse&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;7147&quot; data-end=&quot;7150&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;xmaqkb&quot; data-start=&quot;7152&quot; data-end=&quot;7237&quot;&gt;Q2. How do you use external Azure Data Lake Storage Gen2 data without copying it?&lt;/h3&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;7239&quot; data-end=&quot;7273&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;7239&quot; data-end=&quot;7250&quot;&gt;Answer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xa;Create a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;7260&quot; data-end=&quot;7272&quot;&gt;Shortcut&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;7275&quot; data-end=&quot;7278&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;18q0llp&quot; data-start=&quot;7280&quot; data-end=&quot;7355&quot;&gt;Q3. How do you interactively explore Lakehouse data using Apache Spark?&lt;/h3&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;7357&quot; data-end=&quot;7391&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;7357&quot; data-end=&quot;7368&quot;&gt;Answer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xa;Create a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;7378&quot; data-end=&quot;7390&quot;&gt;Notebook&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;7393&quot; data-end=&quot;7396&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h1 data-section-id=&quot;4jymbh&quot; data-start=&quot;7398&quot; data-end=&quot;7421&quot;&gt;Exam-Focused Keywords&lt;/h1&gt;&#xa;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;3vs4xq&quot; data-start=&quot;7423&quot; data-end=&quot;7440&quot;&gt;Must Remember&lt;/h3&gt;&#xa;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;7442&quot; data-end=&quot;7808&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;wz7asv&quot; data-start=&quot;7442&quot; data-end=&quot;7457&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;7444&quot; data-end=&quot;7457&quot;&gt;Lakehouse&lt;/strong&gt;&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ltxvu7&quot; data-start=&quot;7458&quot; data-end=&quot;7471&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;strong data-start=&