;&lt;span&gt;         ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;11. Power BI / SQL Analytics Reporting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;h1 data-section-id=&quot;pq10tx&quot; data-start=&quot;8579&quot; data-end=&quot;8611&quot;&gt;Top Exam &amp;amp; Interview Takeaways&lt;/h1&gt;&#xa;&lt;ol data-start=&quot;8613&quot; data-end=&quot;9239&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1bq71g0&quot; data-start=&quot;8613&quot; data-end=&quot;8672&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;8616&quot; data-end=&quot;8672&quot;&gt;Fabric Lakehouse tables are Delta tables by default.&lt;/strong&gt;&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;jmlddf&quot; data-start=&quot;8673&quot; data-end=&quot;8725&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;8676&quot; data-end=&quot;8725&quot;&gt;Managed table drop = metadata + data deleted.&lt;/strong&gt;&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;k3tiv9&quot; data-start=&quot;8726&quot; data-end=&quot;8777&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;8729&quot; data-end=&quot;8777&quot;&gt;External table drop = metadata deleted only.&lt;/strong&gt;&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;o9yact&quot; data-start=&quot;8778&quot; data-end=&quot;8818&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;8781&quot; data-end=&quot;8818&quot;&gt;Delta supports ACID transactions.&lt;/strong&gt;&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;pckh4u&quot; data-start=&quot;8819&quot; data-end=&quot;8860&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;8822&quot; data-end=&quot;8860&quot;&gt;Time Travel uses transaction logs.&lt;/strong&gt;&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;mozr5n&quot; data-start=&quot;8861&quot; data-end=&quot;8906&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;8864&quot; data-end=&quot;8906&quot;&gt;DESCRIBE HISTORY shows table versions.&lt;/strong&gt;&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1qszuji&quot; data-start=&quot;8907&quot; data-end=&quot;8964&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;8910&quot; data-end=&quot;8964&quot;&gt;Streaming can read from and write to Delta tables.&lt;/strong&gt;&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1yz1bz9&quot; data-start=&quot;8965&quot; data-end=&quot;9022&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;8968&quot; data-end=&quot;9022&quot;&gt;Checkpointing is mandatory for reliable streaming.&lt;/strong&gt;&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1xt6hub&quot; data-start=&quot;9023&quot; data-end=&quot;9064&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;9026&quot; data-end=&quot;9064&quot;&gt;OPTIMIZE consolidates small files.&lt;/strong&gt;&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;11w1x8k&quot; data-start=&quot;9065&quot; data-end=&quot;9113&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;9069&quot; data-end=&quot;9113&quot;&gt;V-Order is enabled by default in Fabric.&lt;/strong&gt;&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2ceyor&quot; data-start=&quot;9114&quot; data-end=&quot;9170&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;9118&quot; data-end=&quot;9170&quot;&gt;VACUUM removes old files and limits time travel.&lt;/strong&gt;&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;4rlrj3&quot; data-start=&quot;9171&quot; data-end=&quot;9239&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;9175&quot; data-end=&quot;9239&quot;&gt;Partition only very large tables on low-cardinality columns.&lt;/strong&gt;&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;/ol&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;9241&quot; data-end=&quot;9459&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;If you&#39;re studying for DP-700, the highest-value topics from this lesson are: &lt;strong data-start=&quot;9319&quot; data-end=&quot;9459&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Managed vs External Tables, ACID Transactions, Time Travel, Structured Streaming with Delta, OPTIMIZE/V-Order, VACUUM, and&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" link="&lt;h1 data-section-id=&quot;6qmpo2&quot; data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;56&quot;&gt;Microsoft Fabric Delta Lake Tables — Practical Summary&lt;/h1&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;58&quot; data-end=&quot;180&quot;&gt;This module is one of the most important Fabric topics because &lt;strong data-start=&quot;121&quot; data-end=&quot;179&quot;&gt;Lakehouse tables in Fabric are Delta Tables by default&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;182&quot; data-end=&quot;185&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h1 data-section-id=&quot;65bbzh&quot; data-start=&quot;187&quot; data-end=&quot;211&quot;&gt;1. What is Delta Lake?&lt;/h1&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;Delta Lake is a storage layer built on top of Parquet files that adds database-like capabilities to Spark.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;321&quot; data-end=&quot;340&quot;&gt;Without Delta Lake:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;341&quot; data-end=&quot;434&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1amwdxa&quot; data-start=&quot;341&quot; data-end=&quot;372&quot;&gt;&#xa;Files are just Parquet files.&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;4kzbao&quot; data-start=&quot;373&quot; data-end=&quot;391&quot;&gt;&#xa;No transactions.&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;8i1z50&quot; data-start=&quot;392&quot; data-end=&quot;420&quot;&gt;&#xa;No updates/deletes safely.&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;z7amw5&quot; data-start=&quot;421&quot; data-end=&quot;434&quot;&gt;&#xa;No history.&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;436&quot; data-end=&quot;452&quot;&gt;With Delta Lake:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;453&quot; data-end=&quot;602&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2ml8og&quot; data-start=&quot;453&quot; data-end=&quot;472&quot;&gt;&#xa;ACID transactions&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;7h4b4b&quot; data-start=&quot;473&quot; data-end=&quot;494&quot;&gt;&#xa;Updates and deletes&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1fdw9x9&quot; data-start=&quot;495&quot; data-end=&quot;515&quot;&gt;&#xa;Schema enforcement&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1811ysw&quot; data-start=&quot;516&quot; data-end=&quot;533&quot;&gt;&#xa;Version history&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1denurp&quot; data-start=&quot;534&quot; data-end=&quot;547&quot;&gt;&#xa;Time Travel&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1jge1p7&quot; data-start=&quot;548&quot; data-end=&quot;567&quot;&gt;&#xa;Streaming support&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1a3epaq&quot; data-start=&quot;568&quot; data-end=&quot;602&quot;&gt;&#xa;Better performance optimizations&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;604&quot; data-end=&quot;627&quot;&gt;Think of Delta Lake as:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;629&quot; data-end=&quot;707&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;Parquet Files&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;    +&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Transaction Log (_delta_log)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;    =&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Delta Table&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;709&quot; data-end=&quot;712&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h1 data-section-id=&quot;1psko4p&quot; data-start=&quot;714&quot; data-end=&quot;740&quot;&gt;2. Delta Table Structure&lt;/h1&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;742&quot; data-end=&quot;769&quot;&gt;Every Delta Table contains:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;771&quot; data-end=&quot;890&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;Table Folder&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;├── parquet files&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;│&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;└── _delta_log&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;      ├── 000000.json&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;      ├── 000001.json&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;      └── ...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;892&quot; data-end=&quot;916&quot;&gt;The &lt;code data-start=&quot;896&quot; data-end=&quot;908&quot;&gt;_delta_log&lt;/code&gt; stores:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;918&quot; data-end=&quot;975&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;25bld8&quot; data-start=&quot;918&quot; data-end=&quot;927&quot;&gt;&#xa;inserts&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;el4p56&quot; data-start=&quot;928&quot; data-end=&quot;937&quot;&gt;&#xa;updates&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1j9g8bm&quot; data-start=&quot;938&quot; data-end=&quot;947&quot;&gt;&#xa;deletes&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;84wbpo&quot; data-start=&quot;948&quot; data-end=&quot;964&quot;&gt;&#xa;schema changes&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ab89xd&quot; data-start=&quot;965&quot; data-end=&quot;975&quot;&gt;&#xa;versions&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;977&quot; data-end=&quot;990&quot;&gt;This enables:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;992&quot; data-end=&quot;1042&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1hz0kxr&quot; data-start=&quot;992&quot; data-end=&quot;1006&quot;&gt;&#xa;transactions&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1hs1dy6&quot; data-start=&quot;1007&quot; data-end=&quot;1017&quot;&gt;&#xa;rollback&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;u4y30l&quot; data-start=&quot;1018&quot; data-end=&quot;1028&quot;&gt;&#xa;auditing&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;m78pj9&quot; data-start=&quot;1029&quot; data-end=&quot;1042&quot;&gt;&#xa;time travel&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1044&quot; data-end=&quot;1047&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h1 data-section-id=&quot;e1b84c&quot; data-start=&quot;1049&quot; data-end=&quot;1088&quot;&gt;3. ACID Transactions (Very Important)&lt;/h1&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1090&quot; data-end=&quot;1116&quot;&gt;Delta tables support ACID.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;7m4r1c&quot; data-start=&quot;1118&quot; data-end=&quot;1134&quot;&gt;A = Atomicity&lt;/h2&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1136&quot; data-end=&quot;1188&quot;&gt;Transaction succeeds completely or fails completely.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;1190&quot; data-end=&quot;1240&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;sticky bg-token-border-light&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ͼg&quot;&gt;UPDATE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; Products&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ͼg&quot;&gt;SET&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; Price &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ͼg&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; Price &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ͼg&quot;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ͼj&quot;&gt;0.9&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1242&quot; data-end=&quot;1276&quot;&gt;Either all rows update or none do.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1278&quot; data-end=&quot;1281&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;lae61h&quot; data-start=&quot;1283&quot; data-end=&quot;1301&quot;&gt;C = Consistency&lt;/h2&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1303&quot; data-end=&quot;1344&quot;&gt;Database remains valid after transaction.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1346&quot; data-end=&quot;1349&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1v1ti9h&quot; data-start=&quot;1351&quot; data-end=&quot;1367&quot;&gt;I = Isolation&lt;/h2&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1369&quot; data-end=&quot;1429&quot;&gt;Multiple users can update simultaneously without corruption.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1431&quot; data-end=&quot;1434&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;cpe4d9&quot; data-start=&quot;1436&quot; data